    "type": "game",
    "name": "SUPER_HASHIGO",
    "steam_appid": 3754480,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls used during the game are a simple operation with only two keys: &quot;Forward&quot; and &quot;Backward.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, it offers a highly challenging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge various gimmicks and aim for the top of &quot;HASHIGO&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2191 or Up D-Pad: Player character moves forward (climbs the ladder)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2193 or Down D-Pad: Player character moves backward (descends the ladder)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F5 key or L1R1 triggers pressed simultaneously --- Reset (return to title screen)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F4 key --- Switch between fullscreen mode/windowed mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other Controls (Title Menu, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2191\u2193 or Up/Down D-Pad: Move cursor  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z Key or A Button: Confirm  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X Key or B Button: Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stage Structure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main game is divided into five areas,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with each area consisting of dozens of floors.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the game starts, the player character is at the bottom of a floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the character to reach the top of the floor to advance to the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The current floor is displayed in the upper-right corner of the screen.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mistakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various enemies and gimmicks are placed within each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the player character comes into contact with them, they fall (a mistake).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no concept of a game over, but upon making a mistake, you restart from a few floors back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far back you go is random, and in some cases, you may have to restart from dozens of floors earlier.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your spirit breaks, that\u2019s the real game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can save your progress each time you clear an area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can load your save from the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
